			<TRAN name="obcmp_momt_470r" title="내부통제_청탁금지편익제공내역?" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="190" _ulen="142" >

BNFT_OFER_DATE^편익제공일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
